ter one year of service. Hours of work are primarily Monday - Friday, 7:30 a.m. to 4 p.m. Key Responsibilities : Perform or assist in performing general maintenance and repairs throughout campus. Assist Plant Manager in preparation of work estimates, and ordering necessary supplies. Completes all work assigned in an organized and timely manner. Maintain communication with supervisors about work order status. Assists with any inclement weather issues that should occur. Assist in setting up for and taking down from academic, athletic, and other special events. Assist others in moving of furniture, equipment, and any other moving needs as required. Does require some weekend work. Participate in “on call” service rotation. Education, Experience, Skills, and Abilities : Must have a valid driver’s license Maintenance experience required Electrical experience a plus Maintain a high level of customer satisfaction and service. High School diploma or GED required. Ability to successfully lead and work with others. Return to Roanoke College Apply for this job Apply for this job Apply for this job SHARE Not the right job? Join our Talent Network Return to Roanoke College POWERED BY APPLICANT TRACKING"
